          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "step-2.1",
          "claim": "Since $|V_c(p)|\\le |p|/m\\le P_{\\max}/m$ and $|p|/m\\le P_{\\max}/m$ on $K$, the definitions of $G_c,G_N$ and the field suprema give $\\|G_c(t,x,p)\\|_*,\\|G_N(t,x,p)\\|_*\\le B_*$. Thus the vector-field bound hypothesis of [L3] is satisfied uniformly for the family.",
